      "score": 99.0,
      "tick_range_start": 0,
      "tick_range_end": 150,
      "base_form": "Halven Reach, held by the Ostrel Concord, held through the siege everyone expected to break it. The garrison's last stand became the reason children there would later be told to trust their own stubbornness.",
      "expanded_form": "Halven Reach, held by the Ostrel Concord, held through the siege everyone expected to break it. The garrison's last stand became the reason children there would later be told to trust their own stubbornness. Commander Rael Voss signed the surrender terms Kaine Dominion never got to offer.",
