      "entry_id": "ce_0002",
      "category": "lineage_military_action",
      "region": "r_kestrel",
      "score": 9.5,
      "tick_range_start": 180,
      "tick_range_end": 360,
      "base_form": "Word of Halven Reach reached Kestrel Hold before the couriers did. The Voss household had already buried one commander that winter; they raised Rael to the rank before the ink on the last commission dried.",
      "expanded_form": "Word of Halven Reach reached Kestrel Hold before the couriers did. The Voss household had already buried one commander that winter; they raised Rael to the rank before the ink on the last commission dried. The regiment swore the oath to the Ostrel Concord twice that week, once for Rael and once for the dead.",
