    {
      "type": "chronicle_entry",
      "entry_id": "ce_0004",
      "category": "regional_faction_shift",
      "region": "r_pellast",
      "score": 7.0,
      "tick_range_start": 950,
      "tick_range_end": 1300,
      "base_form": "Pellast fell the other direction. Three seasons of Ostrel administration ended in an afternoon when the Kaine Dominion fleet took the orbital relay and the ground garrison simply stopped answering the Concord's calls.",
      "expanded_form": "Pellast fell the other direction. Three seasons of Ostrel administration ended in an afternoon when the Kaine Dominion fleet took the orbital relay and the ground garrison simply stopped answering the Concord's calls. No one in Pellast filed a formal protest; the paperwork for that had left with the last Ostrel administrator three seasons earlier, along with Magistrate Enna Thale.",
