      "entry_id": "ce_0006",
      "category": "chain_expansion",
      "region": "r_underfell",
      "score": 5.0,
      "tick_range_start": 1800,
      "tick_range_end": 2050,
      "base_form": "Undermere's tunnels reached the surface three times in as many years, each time claimed as a new settlement by whichever garrison found the shaft first. The Concord finally paid for proper surveys rather than race the Dominion to another hole in the ground.",
      "expanded_form": "Undermere's tunnels reached the surface three times in as many years, each time claimed as a new settlement by whichever garrison found the shaft first. The Concord finally paid for proper surveys rather than race the Dominion to another hole in the ground. Surveyor Mira Doss filed the first map of the tunnels that anyone actually trusted.",
