      "tick_range_start": 2280,
      "tick_range_end": 2400,
      "base_form": "Thistlewake did what it always did, which was mostly nothing worth writing down. The garrison rotated, the harvest came in average, and the only news worth a mention was that there was no news.",
      "expanded_form": "Thistlewake did what it always did, which was mostly nothing worth writing down. The garrison rotated, the harvest came in average, and the only news worth a mention was that there was no news. Even Warden Tomas Feck's annual report noted, dryly, that Thistlewake remained exactly as unremarkable as promised.",
